# VVR project map

Before any task in this repo — a question, a bugfix, a feature, or a review — read these two files and use them instead of scanning the tree:

1. `.cursor/skills/vvr-project/SKILL.md`
2. `.cursor/skills/vvr-project/PROJECT.md`

Open source files only for the area the map names. If the map and the code disagree, trust the code, then fix the map.

After the task, if behavior, data shapes, APIs, limits, storage, layout, or file responsibilities changed, update `PROJECT.md` in the same turn and add one line to its changelog. Skip the update when the project itself did not change.
